  "primary_dataset": "experimental IV-diffusion diagnostics centered on reduced ChaCha20 and Salsa20: matched-nonce phase intervention, same-stream benchmark, and independent 64-mask ARX follow-up; supporting appendix studies retain the wider seven-cipher ordinary-IV/nonce comparison, retrospective per-mask profiles, Grain/Trivium follow-ups, and auxiliary A5/1 frame-difference tests",
